WEBVTT

00:02:58.121 --> 00:03:01.704
Were you surprised when he said that or
did you immediately know what he meant?

00:03:03.079 --> 00:03:07.288
I think that statement in the
moment makes a lot of sense.

00:03:07.329 --> 00:03:10.121
Maybe it means something
like this gave me hope.

00:03:10.121 --> 00:03:11.704
This gave me something to do every day.

00:03:11.704 --> 00:03:16.621
This gave me a North Star to point
towards and working with you

00:03:16.621 --> 00:03:20.163
on it kept me alive, kept me
focused on what's possible.

00:03:22.121 --> 00:03:23.871
But maybe it also meant something deeper,

00:03:24.163 --> 00:03:28.579
maybe the kind of spiritual
connection that we have to

00:03:28.579 --> 00:03:29.788
the places that we live in.